"b": 4.128639455782313,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 1,
"text": "You're at lunch, laughing at your friend's joke, when your elbow knocks over your juice.",
"anchor": 0.0,
"i": 0,
"vs": 0.0,
"ve": 4.2,
"T0": 0.0,
"T1": 5.868390022675736,
"aT": 1.2,
"speed": 0.7972074925969288
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 4.797913832199546,
"b": 7.078004535147392,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 1,
"text": "It stops. Halfway to the floor.",
"anchor": 4.2,
"freeze": 0.0,
"i": 1,
"vs": 4.2,
"ve": 8.0,
"T0": 5.868390022675736,
"T1": 8.698480725623583,
"aT": 5.868390022675736,
"speed": 1.3427131491022137
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 7.616349206349207,
"b": 12.518412698412698,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 1,
"text": "So does your friend, mouth open, mid-laugh. So does the whole cafeteria.",
"anchor": 8.0,
"i": 2,
"vs": 8.0,
"ve": 13.5,
"T0": 8.698480725623583,
"T1": 14.150544217687074,
"aT": 8.698480725623583,
"speed": 1.00879236054501
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 13.060861678004535,
"b": 15.23517006802721,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 1,
"text": "The only thing still moving is you.",
"anchor": 13.5,
"i": 3,
"vs": 13.5,
"ve": 18.5,
"T0": 14.150544217687074,
"T1": 16.874852607709748,
"aT": 14.150544217687074,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 15.919342403628118,
"b": 18.671020408163262,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 1,
"text": "You poke the juice. It's hanging there like glass.",
"anchor": 18.5,
"i": 4,
"vs": 18.5,
"ve": 22.0,
"T0": 16.874852607709748,
"T1": 20.176530612244893,
"aT": 16.874852607709748,
"speed": 1.0600670311255198
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 19.448526077097508,
"b": 22.6721768707483,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 1,
"text": "You scoop it back into the cup, set it on the table, and blink.",
"anchor": 22.0,
"i": 5,
"vs": 22.0,
"ve": 31.5,
"T0": 20.176530612244893,
"T1": 25.600181405895682,
"aT": 20.176530612244893,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "J",
"a": 0.10224489795918366,
"b": 3.916462585034014,
"sp": "J",
"scene": 1,
"text": "[confused] Wait... didn't you just spill that?",
"anchor": 31.5,
"i": 6,
"vs": 31.5,
"ve": 35.0,
"T0": 25.600181405895682,
"T1": 30.26684807256235,
"aT": 25.600181405895682,
"speed": 0.75
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 23.59979591836735,
"b": 24.911020408163267,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 2,
"text": "So what if you could stop time?",
"anchor": 35.0,
"title": 1,
"i": 7,
"vs": 35.0,
"ve": 39.0,
"T0": 30.26684807256235,
"T1": 33.17807256235827,
"aT": 30.26684807256235,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 25.60700680272109,
"b": 28.600226757369615,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 3,
"text": "Weirdly, your brain already fakes a tiny version of this.",
"anchor": 39.0,
"i": 8,
"vs": 39.0,
"ve": 43.5,
"T0": 33.17807256235827,
"T1": 36.72129251700679,
"aT": 33.17807256235827,
"speed": 1.2700312308007382
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 29.1478231292517,
"b": 33.039750566893424,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 3,
"text": "Glance at a clock, and the very first second seems to last longer than the rest.",
"anchor": 43.5,
"i": 9,
"vs": 43.5,
"ve": 48.5,
"T0": 36.72129251700679,
"T1": 41.16321995464851,
"aT": 36.72129251700679,
"speed": 1.1256374783678513
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 33.582517006802725,
"b": 40.172063492063494,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 3,
"text": "Scientists call it the stopped-clock illusion. Every time your eyes jump, your brain fills the gap and stretches that moment.",
"anchor": 48.5,
"i": 10,
"vs": 48.5,
"ve": 57.0,
"T0": 41.16321995464851,
"T1": 48.30276643990928,
"aT": 41.16321995464851,
"speed": 1.1905518113157214
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 40.68648526077098,
"b": 42.4821768707483,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 3,
"text": "And time isn't even the same everywhere.",
"anchor": 57.0,
"i": 11,
"vs": 57.0,
"ve": 60.5,
"T0": 48.30276643990928,
"T1": 50.64845804988659,
"aT": 48.30276643990928,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 42.95564625850341,
"b": 50.4027664399093,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 3,
"text": "Clocks on GPS satellites run about thirty-eight microseconds a day faster than clocks on the ground, just as Einstein's relativity predicts.",
"anchor": 60.5,
"i": 12,
"vs": 60.5,
"ve": 68.5,
"T0": 50.64845804988659,
"T1": 58.64557823129248,
"aT": 50.64845804988659,
"speed": 1.0003601069546013
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 50.9549433106576,
"b": 56.03410430839002,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 3,
"text": "If engineers didn't correct for it, your phone's map would drift by more than ten kilometers every day.",
"anchor": 68.5,
"i": 13,
"vs": 68.5,
"ve": 75.0,
"T0": 58.64557823129248,
"T1": 64.2747392290249,
"aT": 58.64557823129248,
"speed": 1.1547013849165755
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 56.53442176870748,
"b": 63.046031746031744,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 3,
"text": "A fly can see flickering light about four times faster than you can. To a fly, your hand moves in slow motion.",
"anchor": 75.0,
"i": 14,
"vs": 75.0,
"ve": 85.4,
"T0": 64.2747392290249,
"T1": 71.33634920634917,
"aT": 64.2747392290249,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 63.650158730158736,
"b": 68.74126984126984,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 3,
"text": "But you don't slow time. You stop it. And in real physics, that's a disaster.",
"anchor": 85.4,
"freeze": 1.5,
"i": 15,
"vs": 85.4,
"ve": 93.5,
"T0": 71.33634920634917,
"T1": 76.97746031746027,
"aT": 71.33634920634917,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 69.23859410430839,
"b": 74.66981859410431,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 3,
"text": "You see because light reaches your eyes. Stop time, and light stops too. Pitch black.",
"anchor": 93.5,
"i": 16,
"vs": 93.5,
"ve": 104.5,
"T0": 76.97746031746027,
"T1": 82.95868480725619,
"aT": 76.97746031746027,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 75.15782312925171,
"b": 79.90818594104309,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 3,
"text": "Sound is just air vibrating. Frozen air can't vibrate. Total silence.",
"anchor": 104.5,
"i": 17,
"vs": 104.5,
"ve": 109.0,
"T0": 82.95868480725619,
"T1": 88.25904761904756,
"aT": 82.95868480725619,
"speed": 0.8489984855355824
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 80.48834467120182,
"b": 85.53587301587302,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 3,
"text": "And every molecule of air around you would be locked in place, like being sealed inside a wall.",
"anchor": 109.0,
"i": 18,
"vs": 109.0,
"ve": 116.3,
"T0": 88.25904761904756,
"T1": 94.90657596371877,
"aT": 88.25904761904756,
"speed": 1.098152519477683
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 86.16943310657597,
"b": 89.02877551020407,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 4,
"text": "So your power has rules, and you learn them fast.",
"anchor": 116.3,
"i": 19,
"vs": 116.3,
"ve": 121.3,
"T0": 94.90657596371877,
"T1": 98.31591836734687,
"aT": 94.90657596371877,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 89.72764172335602,
"b": 96.72521541950114,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 4,
"text": "Rule one. A small bubble moves with you. Inside it, air flows and light reaches you. You can see, and breathe.",
"anchor": 121.3,
"i": 20,
"vs": 121.3,
"ve": 128.4,
"T0": 98.31591836734687,
"T1": 105.86349206349199,
"aT": 98.31591836734687,
"speed": 0.9406996587030728
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 97.36988662131519,
"b": 104.00269841269841,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 4,
"text": "Rule two. Anything you touch moves again, but only while you hold it. Let go, and it freezes right where it is.",
"anchor": 128.4,
"i": 21,
"vs": 128.4,
"ve": 136.2,
"T0": 105.86349206349199,
"T1": 113.0463038548752,
"aT": 105.86349206349199,
"speed": 1.0859257107860139
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 104.5278231292517,
"b": 110.71716553287982,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 4,
"text": "A basketball hangs over the hoop. Walk home through a frozen rainstorm, and every drop you bump into falls onto you.",
"anchor": 136.2,
"i": 22,
"vs": 136.2,
"ve": 160.8,
"T0": 113.0463038548752,
"T1": 119.78564625850332,
"aT": 113.0463038548752,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 111.56013605442178,
"b": 117.16709750566893,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 4,
"text": "Rule three. The world stops. You don't. Every minute in there is a real minute of your life.",
"anchor": 160.8,
"i": 23,
"vs": 160.8,
"ve": 172.0,
"T0": 119.78564625850332,
"T1": 125.94260770975048,
"aT": 119.78564625850332,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 117.56151927437642,
"b": 124.61190476190477,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 4,
"text": "You read a whole book. Eat a whole pizza. Nap on the couch. When you let go, the clock hasn't moved. But you're starving.",
"anchor": 172.0,
"i": 24,
"vs": 172.0,
"ve": 182.0,
"T0": 125.94260770975048,
"T1": 133.54299319727883,
"aT": 125.94260770975048,
"speed": 1.3157227375386735
},
{
"src": "NX",
"a": 0.043401360544217685,
"b": 2.405124716553288,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 4,
"text": "And there's one thing the rules can't explain.",
"anchor": 182.0,
"i": 25,
"vs": 182.0,
"ve": 187.0,
"T0": 133.54299319727883,
"T1": 137.5047165532879,
"aT": 133.54299319727883,
"speed": 1.262077018178488
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 125.25027210884353,
"b": 129.58267573696145,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 5,
"text": "You show your best friend. One second you're across the room, the next you're beside him.",
"anchor": 187.0,
"i": 26,
"vs": 187.0,
"ve": 196.0,
"T0": 137.5047165532879,
"T1": 142.5371201814058,
"aT": 137.5047165532879,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "J",
"a": 4.547233560090703,
"b": 5.699455782312926,
"sp": "J",
"scene": 5,
"text": "[stunned] Bro. You just teleported.",
"anchor": 196.0,
"i": 27,
"vs": 196.0,
"ve": 204.0,
"T0": 142.5371201814058,
"T1": 144.38934240362804,
"aT": 142.5371201814058,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 130.14154195011335,
"b": 133.93848072562358,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 5,
"text": "At first, you use it for the good stuff. Front of the lunch line, every time.",
"anchor": 204.0,
"i": 28,
"vs": 204.0,
"ve": 217.5,
"T0": 144.38934240362804,
"T1": 148.73628117913827,
"aT": 144.38934240362804,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 134.30784580498863,
"b": 139.3379365079365,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 5,
"text": "You stop time during a math test and peek at everyone's answers. Perfect score. Again.",
"anchor": 217.5,
"i": 29,
"vs": 217.5,
"ve": 234.0,
"T0": 148.73628117913827,
"T1": 154.31637188208614,
"aT": 148.73628117913827,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 139.81968253968253,
"b": 142.7049886621315,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 5,
"text": "At a penalty kick, you nudge the goalie one step to the left.",
"anchor": 234.0,
"i": 30,
"vs": 234.0,
"ve": 249.4,
"T0": 154.31637188208614,
"T1": 157.75167800453514,
"aT": 154.31637188208614,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 143.27684807256236,
"b": 147.25480725623584,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 5,
"text": "And when a little kid's ice cream goes flying, you catch it mid-air and put it back in his hand.",
"anchor": 249.4,
"i": 31,
"vs": 249.4,
"ve": 262.0,
"T0": 157.75167800453514,
"T1": 162.27963718820862,
"aT": 157.75167800453514,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N1",
"a": 147.96115646258502,
"b": 150.5452380952381,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 5,
"text": "Your mom's coffee mug keeps ending up on the ceiling fan.",
"anchor": 262.0,
"i": 32,
"vs": 262.0,
"ve": 275.0,
"T0": 162.27963718820862,
"T1": 166.4637188208617,
"aT": 162.27963718820862,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 0.039931972789115644,
"b": 7.0462358276643995,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 6,
"text": "But the frozen world is strange. No wind. No sound. Birds hang in the sky like they're on strings.",
"anchor": 275.0,
"i": 33,
"vs": 275.0,
"ve": 281.0,
"T0": 166.4637188208617,
"T1": 174.4637188208617,
"aT": 166.4637188208617,
"speed": 0.75
},
{
"src": "NX",
"a": 2.941224489795918,
"b": 5.914285714285715,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 6,
"text": "Except, sometimes, they're not where you left them.",
"anchor": 281.0,
"i": 34,
"vs": 281.0,
"ve": 296.5,
"T0": 174.4637188208617,
"T1": 177.98678004535148,
"aT": 174.4637188208617,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 7.830294784580499,
"b": 11.849954648526078,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 6,
"text": "It's the quietest place in the universe, and you're the only one in it.",
"anchor": 296.5,
"i": 35,
"vs": 296.5,
"ve": 300.5,
"T0": 177.98678004535148,
"T1": 182.55643990929707,
"aT": 177.98678004535148,
"speed": 0.8753386727007472
},
{
"src": "NX",
"a": 6.520997732426304,
"b": 8.276439909297052,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 6,
"text": "At least, that's what you think.",
"anchor": 300.5,
"i": 36,
"vs": 300.5,
"ve": 304.0,
"T0": 182.55643990929707,
"T1": 186.06188208616783,
"aT": 182.55643990929707,
"speed": 0.9984475063070057
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 12.414376417233559,
"b": 18.994807256235823,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 6,
"text": "And rule three adds up. One extra hour a day, for a year, is more than two weeks of life nobody else lived.",
"anchor": 304.0,
"i": 37,
"vs": 304.0,
"ve": 314.0,
"T0": 186.06188208616783,
"T1": 193.19231292517009,
"aT": 186.06188208616783,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 19.618480725623584,
"b": 23.287528344671202,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 6,
"text": "You're aging faster than everyone around you, and nobody can see it.",
"anchor": 314.0,
"i": 38,
"vs": 314.0,
"ve": 325.0,
"T0": 193.19231292517009,
"T1": 197.4113605442177,
"aT": 193.19231292517009,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 24.00673469387755,
"b": 29.53077097505669,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 6,
"text": "Some nights, one thought keeps you awake. What if you let go, and time never starts again?",
"anchor": 325.0,
"i": 39,
"vs": 325.0,
"ve": 340.3,
"T0": 197.4113605442177,
"T1": 204.53539682539684,
"aT": 197.4113605442177,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 30.574784580498868,
"b": 33.41140589569161,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 7,
"text": "Then a kid shoves you into a locker, and everyone laughs.",
"anchor": 340.3,
"i": 40,
"vs": 340.3,
"ve": 346.8,
"T0": 204.53539682539684,
"T1": 207.92201814058959,
"aT": 204.53539682539684,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 34.215102040816326,
"b": 38.06798185941043,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 7,
"text": "For the first time, you stop time not for fun, but for revenge.",
"anchor": 346.8,
"i": 41,
"vs": 346.8,
"ve": 353.0,
"T0": 207.92201814058959,
"T1": 212.3248979591837,
"aT": 207.92201814058959,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 38.75233560090703,
"b": 45.91249433106576,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 7,
"text": "You tie his shoelaces together. You drop his phone in the fish tank. You let go. One step, and he hits the floor.",
"anchor": 353.0,
"i": 42,
"vs": 353.0,
"ve": 360.0,
"T0": 212.3248979591837,
"T1": 220.0350566893424,
"aT": 212.3248979591837,
"speed": 0.907893111541154
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 46.46272108843537,
"b": 49.731156462585034,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 7,
"text": "Now they're laughing at him. And it feels amazing.",
"anchor": 360.0,
"i": 43,
"vs": 360.0,
"ve": 369.3,
"T0": 220.0350566893424,
"T1": 223.85349206349207,
"aT": 220.0350566893424,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 50.17954648526077,
"b": 53.20727891156462,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 7,
"text": "Nobody can stop you. So it gets easier.",
"anchor": 369.3,
"i": 44,
"vs": 369.3,
"ve": 379.5,
"T0": 223.85349206349207,
"T1": 227.4312244897959,
"aT": 223.85349206349207,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 53.70605442176871,
"b": 58.364058956916104,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 7,
"text": "A free snack. Free shoes. A brand-new phone, straight out of a locked glass case.",
"anchor": 379.5,
"i": 45,
"vs": 379.5,
"ve": 389.0,
"T0": 227.4312244897959,
"T1": 232.6392290249433,
"aT": 227.4312244897959,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "NX",
"a": 8.841111111111111,
"b": 15.819773242630385,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 7,
"text": "Then one night, there's a list on your desk. Things to take. In your handwriting. You don't remember writing it.",
"anchor": 389.0,
"i": 46,
"vs": 389.0,
"ve": 393.5,
"T0": 232.6392290249433,
"T1": 238.6392290249433,
"aT": 232.6392290249433,
"speed": 0.75
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 59.008253968253975,
"b": 64.56126984126985,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 7,
"text": "Cameras freeze too, so the footage just skips a single frame. The phone is there. Then it's gone.",
"anchor": 393.5,
"i": 47,
"vs": 393.5,
"ve": 407.0,
"T0": 238.6392290249433,
"T1": 244.74224489795915,
"aT": 238.6392290249433,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 65.20249433106576,
"b": 68.57244897959184,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 7,
"text": "You start wearing your hood up. Your best friend notices the new stuff.",
"anchor": 407.0,
"i": 48,
"vs": 407.0,
"ve": 417.5,
"T0": 244.74224489795915,
"T1": 248.81219954648523,
"aT": 244.74224489795915,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "J",
"a": 7.078117913832199,
"b": 10.500884353741496,
"sp": "J",
"scene": 7,
"text": "[uneasy] You're not using it for... you know, bad stuff, right?",
"anchor": 417.5,
"i": 49,
"vs": 417.5,
"ve": 423.0,
"T0": 248.81219954648523,
"T1": 252.93496598639453,
"aT": 248.81219954648523,
"speed": 1.3340556832807156
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 69.1121768707483,
"b": 72.07299319727892,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 7,
"text": "He laughs it off. But he never asks to see the trick again.",
"anchor": 423.0,
"i": 50,
"vs": 423.0,
"ve": 431.5,
"T0": 252.93496598639453,
"T1": 258.99578231292514,
"aT": 252.93496598639453,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 72.73605442176871,
"b": 77.78163265306122,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 8,
"text": "Then you hear about the armored truck. Every Friday, it carries cash for every bank in town.",
"anchor": 431.5,
"i": 51,
"vs": 431.5,
"ve": 438.0,
"T0": 258.99578231292514,
"T1": 264.59136054421765,
"aT": 258.99578231292514,
"speed": 1.1616315117622045
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 78.36598639455782,
"b": 82.32698412698413,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 8,
"text": "So on Friday, you're on the overpass, hood up. You stop time.",
"anchor": 438.0,
"freeze": -0.3,
"i": 52,
"vs": 438.0,
"ve": 440.5,
"T0": 264.59136054421765,
"T1": 267.92469387755096,
"aT": 264.59136054421765,
"speed": 0.75
},
{
"src": "NX",
"a": 16.366303854875284,
"b": 20.036031746031746,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 8,
"text": "But the silence is already there. Someone stopped it first.",
"anchor": 440.5,
"i": 53,
"vs": 440.5,
"ve": 443.0,
"T0": 267.92469387755096,
"T1": 271.2580272108843,
"aT": 267.92469387755096,
"speed": 0.75
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 82.84360544217687,
"b": 91.01024943310658,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 8,
"text": "And that's when you see it. The car next to the truck is mid-crash. A tire hangs in the air. The driver's face is frozen in terror.",
"anchor": 443.0,
"i": 54,
"vs": 443.0,
"ve": 458.5,
"T0": 271.2580272108843,
"T1": 279.974671201814,
"aT": 271.2580272108843,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 91.6201133786848,
"b": 95.30283446712018,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 8,
"text": "Five minutes. That's all it would take to push that car back into its lane.",
"anchor": 458.5,
"i": 55,
"vs": 458.5,
"ve": 465.8,
"T0": 279.974671201814,
"T1": 284.20739229024935,
"aT": 279.974671201814,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 95.8652380952381,
"b": 99.14600907029478,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 8,
"text": "You once stopped time to save a kid's ice cream.",
"anchor": 465.8,
"i": 56,
"vs": 465.8,
"ve": 469.0,
"T0": 284.20739229024935,
"T1": 288.038163265306,
"aT": 284.20739229024935,
"speed": 0.8353409851009532
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 99.32199546485262,
"b": 103.85215419501135,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 8,
"text": "Today, you open the truck. You take the bags. You walk away. And you let go.",
"anchor": 469.0,
"i": 57,
"vs": 469.0,
"ve": 478.3,
"T0": 288.038163265306,
"T1": 298.66832199546474,
"aT": 288.038163265306,
"speed": 0.8748693444826051
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 104.42233560090703,
"b": 112.19843537414967,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 9,
"text": "The news calls it a mystery. Every car froze at the same instant, the cash vanished, and the only thing on camera is a figure in a hood.",
"anchor": 478.3,
"i": 58,
"vs": 478.3,
"ve": 485.0,
"T0": 298.66832199546474,
"T1": 306.99442176870735,
"aT": 298.66832199546474,
"speed": 0.804698500194725
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 112.74458049886621,
"b": 114.9987074829932,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 9,
"text": "The driver of that car is still in the hospital.",
"anchor": 485.0,
"i": 59,
"vs": 485.0,
"ve": 499.0,
"T0": 306.99442176870735,
"T1": 309.79854875283434,
"aT": 306.99442176870735,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 115.55662131519274,
"b": 117.55315192743764,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 9,
"text": "Your phone buzzes. It's your best friend.",
"anchor": 499.0,
"i": 60,
"vs": 499.0,
"ve": 504.0,
"T0": 309.79854875283434,
"T1": 312.4950793650792,
"aT": 309.79854875283434,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "J",
"a": 11.89562358276644,
"b": 13.4275283446712,
"sp": "J",
"scene": 9,
"text": "[quietly] Was that you on the news?",
"anchor": 504.0,
"i": 61,
"vs": 504.0,
"ve": 508.5,
"T0": 312.4950793650792,
"T1": 314.726984126984,
"aT": 312.4950793650792,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 118.00791383219955,
"b": 121.79582766439908,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 9,
"text": "You stare at the message. Then you type one word. No.",
"anchor": 508.5,
"i": 62,
"vs": 508.5,
"ve": 513.0,
"T0": 314.726984126984,
"T1": 319.06489795918355,
"aT": 314.726984126984,
"speed": 1.037365004025052
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 122.25392290249434,
"b": 129.13632653061225,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 9,
"text": "But someone else is studying that footage. Every time you stop time, every camera in town skips the exact same frame.",
"anchor": 513.0,
"i": 63,
"vs": 513.0,
"ve": 517.5,
"T0": 319.06489795918355,
"T1": 325.06489795918355,
"aT": 319.06489795918355,
"speed": 0.75
},
{
"src": "NX",
"a": 20.630068027210886,
"b": 25.8637641723356,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 9,
"text": "And one second later, they skip again. Someone has been following you through the silence.",
"anchor": 517.5,
"map": 1,
"i": 64,
"vs": 517.5,
"ve": 522.0,
"T0": 325.06489795918355,
"T1": 331.06489795918355,
"aT": 325.06489795918355,
"speed": 0.75
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 133.86351473922903,
"b": 137.91219954648528,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 10,
"text": "The next morning, a black van is parked across the street. A team is waiting.",
"anchor": 522.0,
"i": 65,
"vs": 522.0,
"ve": 526.5,
"T0": 331.06489795918355,
"T1": 335.6635827664398,
"aT": 331.06489795918355,
"speed": 0.9785406455557606
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 138.32179138321996,
"b": 146.34668934240364,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 10,
"text": "A boy floating a soda can. A girl hovering off the ground. And a face you know from a video called the slowest rescue ever recorded.",
"anchor": 526.5,
"i": 66,
"vs": 526.5,
"ve": 559.5,
"T0": 335.6635827664398,
"T1": 344.23848072562345,
"aT": 335.6635827664398,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 146.8024716553288,
"b": 153.78149659863945,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 10,
"text": "You don't run. You stop time. The van, the team, the soda can, all frozen. You walk right between them.",
"anchor": 559.5,
"freeze": 1.4,
"i": 67,
"vs": 559.5,
"ve": 571.0,
"T0": 344.23848072562345,
"T1": 351.7675056689341,
"aT": 344.23848072562345,
"speed": 1.35
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 154.33970521541949,
"b": 158.10358276643993,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 10,
"text": "And then, in a world where nothing moves, someone says your name.",
"anchor": 571.0,
"i": 68,
"vs": 571.0,
"ve": 575.5,
"T0": 351.7675056689341,
"T1": 357.7313832199546,
"aT": 351.7675056689341,
"speed": 0.754542654758234
},
{
"src": "W",
"a": 0.034399092970521544,
"b": 2.6253061224489795,
"sp": "W",
"scene": 10,
"text": "Hello. I've been wondering when we'd meet.",
"anchor": 575.5,
"i": 69,
"vs": 575.5,
"ve": 579.5,
"T0": 357.7313832199546,
"T1": 361.022290249433,
"aT": 357.7313832199546,
"speed": 1.215470374632224
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 158.58224489795919,
"b": 162.0839909297052,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 10,
"text": "A woman in a gray coat. And she is not frozen.",
"anchor": 579.5,
"i": 70,
"vs": 579.5,
"ve": 581.5,
"T0": 361.022290249433,
"T1": 363.6889569160997,
"aT": 361.022290249433,
"speed": 0.75
},
{
"src": "WX",
"a": 0.15999999999999998,
"b": 2.290430839002268,
"sp": "W",
"scene": 10,
"text": "I've been in here with you since the cafeteria.",
"anchor": 581.5,
"i": 71,
"vs": 581.5,
"ve": 583.5,
"T0": 363.6889569160997,
"T1": 366.3556235827664,
"aT": 363.6889569160997,
"speed": 0.75
},
{
"src": "WX",
"a": 4.622131519274376,
"b": 9.104104308390022,
"sp": "W",
"scene": 10,
"text": "I was fourteen the first time I stopped the world. I'm twenty-six.",
"anchor": 583.5,
"i": 72,
"vs": 583.5,
"ve": 586.0,
"T0": 366.3556235827664,
"T1": 369.6889569160997,
"aT": 366.3556235827664,
"speed": 0.75
},
{
"src": "NX",
"a": 26.351315192743765,
"b": 27.27328798185941,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 10,
"text": "She looks sixty.",
"anchor": 586.0,
"i": 73,
"vs": 586.0,
"ve": 587.0,
"T0": 369.6889569160997,
"T1": 371.022290249433,
"aT": 369.6889569160997,
"speed": 0.75
},
{
"src": "WX",
"a": 11.002108843537416,
"b": 22.519410430839002,
"sp": "W",
"scene": 10,
"text": "Every hour in here is an hour of your life. I've spent thirty-four years in the silence. Friday's crash? I froze it. I needed to see what you'd do.",
"anchor": 587.0,
"i": 74,
"vs": 587.0,
"ve": 591.0,
"T0": 371.022290249433,
"T1": 376.3556235827663,
"aT": 371.022290249433,
"speed": 0.75
},
{
"src": "W",
"a": 4.837551020408163,
"b": 8.871133786848072,
"sp": "W",
"scene": 10,
"text": "You could have saved that driver. Let's talk about why you didn't.",
"anchor": 591.0,
"i": 75,
"vs": 591.0,
"ve": 593.2,
"T0": 376.3556235827663,
"T1": 379.2889569160997,
"aT": 376.3556235827663,
"speed": 0.75
},
{
"src": "N2",
"a": 162.6048072562358,
"b": 168.72383219954648,
"sp": "N",
"scene": 11,
"text": "So what would you do if you could stop time? Join Project IF, or fight them? Tell us in the comments.",
"anchor": 593.2,
"last": 1,
"i": 76,
"vs": 593.2,
"ve": 595.0,
"T0": 379.2889569160997,
"T1": 389.4579818594104,
"aT": 379.2889569160997,
"speed": 0.75
}
]